<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1818539908"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:02.775"><div begin="12.527" end="30.807" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.527" end="18.001" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.527" end="13.198">细</span><span begin="13.198" end="13.714">雨带</span><span begin="13.714" end="14.216">风</span><span begin="14.216" end="15.880">湿透黄昏</span><span begin="15.880" end="16.504">的</span><span begin="16.902" end="17.445">街</span><span begin="17.445" end="18.001">道</span></p><p begin="18.785" end="24.042" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.785" end="19.243">抹</span><span begin="19.243" end="19.799">去雨</span><span begin="19.799" end="20.433">水</span><span begin="20.433" end="22.043">双眼无故</span><span begin="22.043" end="22.774">地</span><span begin="23.022" end="23.577">仰</span><span begin="23.577" end="24.042">望</span></p><p begin="24.145" end="27.319" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.145" end="25.063">望向</span><span begin="25.063" end="25.839">孤单</span><span begin="25.839" end="26.139">的</span><span begin="26.139" end="26.645">晚</span><span begin="26.645" end="27.319">灯</span></p><p begin="27.595" end="30.807" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.595" end="28.093">是那</span><span begin="28.093" end="29.704">伤感的记</span><span begin="29.704" end="30.807">忆</span></p></div><div begin="34.139" end="52.215" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.139" end="39.682" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.139" end="34.622">再</span><span begin="34.622" end="35.277">次泛</span><span begin="35.277" end="35.795">起</span><span begin="35.795" end="37.388">心里无数</span><span begin="37.388" end="38.213">的</span><span begin="38.393" end="38.959">思</span><span begin="38.959" end="39.682">念</span></p><p begin="40.336" end="45.610" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.336" end="40.821">以</span><span begin="40.821" end="41.367">往片</span><span begin="41.367" end="41.898">刻</span><span begin="41.898" end="43.481">欢笑